---
description: Put charts in white cards, never on the canvas
globs: components/**, app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Charts

Victory (or any) charts sit inside a white card. Do not place a plot, legend, or axis labels directly on the mist canvas.

- Card chrome matches telemetry: `Colors.Card`, `Radii.Card` (16), `1px` `Colors.Hairline`, screen margin `Space.screen`, top gap `Space.md`.
- Title and legend live **inside** the card. Use the micro-label style (Geist 12, weight 600, uppercase) for the chart name.
- Empty states stay in the same card. Do not swap a chart for a full-width placeholder outside the card.
- Give the plot a fixed height (`SChart`). Do not let the line float on `Colors.Canvas`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<>
  <SSection>Heart rate</SSection>
  <SChart><CartesianChart /></SChart>
</>

// ✅ GOOD
<Wrapper>
  <STitle>Heart rate</STitle>
  <SChart><CartesianChart /></SChart>
</Wrapper>
```
